{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_240_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_240","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春，用田賦。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_240_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_240","textTraditional":"古者公田什一，用田賦，非正也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_240_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_240","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，甲辰，孟子卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_240_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_240","textTraditional":"孟子者何也？昭公夫人也。其不言夫人何也？諱取同姓也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_240_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_240","textTraditional":"三、公會吳於橐皋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_240_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_240","textTraditional":"四、秋，公會衞侯、宋皇瑗於鄖。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_240_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_240","textTraditional":"五、宋向巢帥師伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_240_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_240","textTraditional":"六、冬，十有二月，螽。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}